{"availability":"available","full":"daimon3332/address","name":"address","description":"A self-hosted address and synthetic test-profile generator for 27 countries and regions, built from real open-data streets, administrative areas, coordinates, and postcodes. Supports multilingual output, IP-nearby generation, map previews, and API access. 基于真实开放数据的自托管地址与合成测试资料生成器，覆盖 27 个国家和地区，支持多语言地址、IP 附近生成、地图预览与 API 调用","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":2184,"forks":300,"created":"2026-07-15T00:01:20Z","updated":"2026-10-11T00:58:52Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://address.daimonna.com/","topics":["address","address-generation","address-generator","mock-data","mock-data-generator"],"demo":"https://address.333186.xyz/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:17.012Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:17.012Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:17.012Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T04:29:17.012Z","stars":2184,"forks":300}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Self-hosted real-address generator backed by official registries and open map data for 27 countries and regions","Address returns addresses that actually exist instead of randomly assembled strings. Every record comes from an official address register, open map data, or a validated geocoding result, and carries its source, precision, and coordinates. Missing fields stay empty; nothing is invented.","Use it for form and checkout testing, address-format validation, logistics demos, and anywhere an address must look real and be real."],"features":["27 countries and regions – Region, city, district, and postcode filters that follow each country's real administrative hierarchy. A filter with no data returns an error instead of silently switching to another area.","Traceable sources – Residential communities for China; premise- and street-level addresses elsewhere, labelled with precision and residential evidence.","Ten display languages – Native, English, Simplified and Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, German, French, Spanish, and Portuguese.","Hands-off synchronization – Incremental imports with bounded retries, exponential backoff, quota waits, and source-exhaustion detection, so failing work is never repeated forever.","Admin console – Dashboard, country workspace, sync history, quick locations, provider credentials, translation routing, access control, and API tokens."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daimon3332/address/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fa44223090d57a03c1a232c42dc8fc03766d0fd287bf9b10cdc596c9b22d31e5","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:17.148Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:17.148Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Self-hosted real-address generator backed by official registries and open map data for 27 countries and regions","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daimon3332/address/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Open and sign in with the initial password admin.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daimon3332/address/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"See API keys for how to obtain each one.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daimon3332/address/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"fa44223090d57a03c1a232c42dc8fc03766d0fd287bf9b10cdc596c9b22d31e5","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daimon3332/address/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:17.148Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T00:58:52Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daimon3332/address/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T08:02:14.121Z","hash":"fa44223090d57a03c1a232c42dc8fc03766d0fd287bf9b10cdc596c9b22d31e5","originalBytes":8965,"storedBytes":8965,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["api","address","data","docs","compose","country","docker","admin","sources","countries","open","residential","source","translation","ke